WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.796
Bird and Kip were out on the ocean.

2
00:00:13.797 --> 00:00:22.775
The box floated on the waves.

3
00:00:22.776 --> 00:00:26.972
It bobbed up and down.

4
00:00:26.973 --> 00:00:30.627
"We're sailing, Kip!" said Bird.

5
00:00:30.628 --> 00:00:35.862
"And I'm having a lot of fun!"

6
00:00:35.863 --> 00:00:42.828
But Kip wasn't having fun at all.

7
00:00:42.829 --> 00:00:47.413
"We're lost!" he cried.

8
00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:51.307
"We'll be lost at sea forever!"

9
00:00:51.308 --> 00:00:54.613
"Oh, don't be silly, Kip," said Bird.

10
00:00:54.614 --> 00:00:58.130
"We won't be lost at sea forever.

11
00:00:58.131 --> 00:01:02.926
We're not even lost."

12
00:01:02.927 --> 00:01:08.557
"I miss my hole!" cried Kip.

13
00:01:08.558 --> 00:01:12.204
"And I miss our tree!

14
00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:21.109
I don't like sailing anymore!"

15
00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:28.951
Soon the box landed on some rocks.

16
00:01:28.952 --> 00:01:38.938
"Oh no!" said Kip.

17
00:01:38.939 --> 00:01:44.529
"Now we're stuck in a faraway land!"

18
00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.595
"No, we aren't," said Bird.

19
00:01:47.596 --> 00:01:49.466
"We're still home.

20
00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:59.476
See? There's the roller coaster."

21
00:01:59.477 --> 00:02:04.251
"Hmm," said Kip. "You're right."

22
00:02:04.252 --> 00:02:07.817
"Do you know what this means?" asked Kip.

23
00:02:07.818 --> 00:02:20.847
"We sailed all the way around the world!"

